/**
 * Maps RapidoMeet internal CMS tool ids (cms_*) to RapidoCMS MCP tool names.
 * Auto-generated by `npm run list-cms-tools` — re-run after CMS MCP changes.
 *
 * Discovered tools (38):
 * - list_connected_accounts: Returns a list of connected social media accounts for the current company. Use "page_id" as the unique identifier for po [networks]
 * - upload_file_tool: Uploads a file from public url to user's library [type, name, file_url]
 * - list_all_files: Return a list of user's library files. [search, type]
 * - list_drafts_tool: Return a list of drafts that users created and can schedule to publish. [name, social, id]
 * - create_draft_tool: Create a new draft for user [post_name, social_type, account_id, post_type, media_type, media_source, media_url, media_caption]
 * - edit_draft_tool: Edits a draft for users. [draft_id, post_name, social_type, account_id, post_type, media_type, media_source, media_url, media_caption]
 * - delete_draft_tool: Deletes a user's draft [draft_id]
 * - create_post_template: Create a new post template for the user [name, height, width, html, css, type]
 * - schedule_draft_tool: Schedule a user's draft [draft_id, post_date, post_heure]
 * - cancel_schedules_post: Delete a scheduled post for users [post_id]
 * - list_scheduled_posts: Return a list of posts that users scheduled to publish. [name, social, id, start_date, end_date]
 * - generate_image: Generate an image [prompt, size]
 * - post_insights: Insights for posts published by the user [post_ids]
 * - list_prompts: Shows all prompts for users [search, type]
 * - add_prompt: Add a prompt to users library. [title, content, type]
 * - delete_prompt: Delete a prompt from users library. [prompt_id]
 * - edit_prompt: Edits a prompt for user. [prompt_id, type, title, content]
 * - list_campagnes: Return a list of campagnes that users created. [serach]
 * - list_posts_campagne: Return a list of posts for a campagne that users created. [campagne_id]
 * - add_post_campagne: add a post to a user's campagne [campagne_id, post_id]
 * - remove_post_campagne: Remove a post from a user's campagne [campagne_id, post_id]
 * - ingishts_campagne: Return a insights of a campagne that users created. [campagne_id]
 * - create_campagne: Create a new campagne for user [name, description, facebook, instagram, linkedin, tiktok]
 * - edit_campagne: Edits a draft for users. [campagne_id, name, description, facebook, instagram, linkedin, tiktok]
 * - delete_campagne: Deletes a user's campagne [campagne_id]
 * - add_digital_card: add a digital card to a user's cards [card_name, owner_first_name, owner_last_name, owner_email, owner_phone, other_info]
 * - edit_digital_card: Edits a digital card for users. [card_id, card_name, owner_first_name, owner_last_name, owner_email, owner_phone, other_info]
 * - delete_digital_card: Deletes a user's digital card [card_id]
 * - list_digital_card: Return a list of digital cards that users created. [name, card_id]
 * - list_card_page: Return a list of digital cards associated pages for users. [card_id]
 * - list_card_templates: Return a list of templates that can be associated to digital cards [type, search]
 * - assign_card_template: Assign a template to a digital card for users. [template_id, card_id]
 * - edit_card_page: Edits a digital card's page for users. [text, height, width, background, image_url, page_id]
 * - add_card_page_link: add links to a digital card page [page_id, image_url, link_url, name]
 * - delete_card_page_link: A description of what this tool does. [link_id]
 * - get_brand: Returns the brand informations of a user.
 * - get_profile: Returns the profile informations of a user.
 * - get_company: Returns the profile informations of a user.
 */

